{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026aBAFjN7Fl81792714894.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>距離美國中期選舉不僅兩星期，弗吉尼亞州參議院、屬民主黨的臨時議長盧卡斯被控洗黑錢、非法分銷大麻等罪名。</p><p></p><p>在弗吉尼亞州具備影響力的82歲資深州參議員盧卡斯，周四出庭應訊。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.LUCAS-0700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wi1iXJ3ARh1792716101.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>案情指，她及另外六名被告，包括她的女兒及孫兒，在當地非法經營大麻生意，當局指控盧卡斯串謀分銷大麻、參與敲詐及洗黑錢，並指控她在政壇利用影響力去謀取私利。雖然弗吉尼亞州議會通過大麻合法化，但明年才獲准銷售娛樂用大麻。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.LUCAS-0700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263KiumNUkK91792716105.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當局在5月曾搜查盧卡斯的寓所，司法部指盧卡斯「自首」，又稱她考慮自身利益，沒有將選民放在首位，盧卡斯就在社交平台發文，稱司法部、聯邦調查局，甚至整個聯邦政府去對付她。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.794705+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:38:00.177897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:08.333349+00:00","content_hash":"84555d9b3cfcac66ece739cb9c7e8b94ca15c44ed5e3aef8ad6019357c58667e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.794705+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}